# LeakSanitizer suppressions of the sanitizer runs: the unit tests ("./dev.sh
# asan" and the unit-tests-asan mode of the CI images) and the functional
# tests (the functional-tests-asan mode), through
# LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=... Each entry names a library or one of its
# functions, or one function of the node, never a test, with the reason in the
# comment above it.

# Berkeley DB, the wallet database library: memory from its allocator.
leak:__os_malloc

# Wallet loading at start-up (CWallet::CreateWalletFromFile).
leak:CWallet::CreateWalletFromFile

# The HTTP server's reply events (HTTPRequest::WriteReply).
leak:HTTPRequest::WriteReply

# libevent: the event of an HTTP reply (event_new, called by HTTPRequest::WriteReply).
leak:event_new
